24→    traces:\n   325→      - prd002-sys R2.3\n   326→\n   327→  - name: stat_hard_link_count\n   328→    description: Stat returns correct Nlink for a file with multiple hard links.\n   329→    inputs:\n   330→      setup: \"create testFile, create hard link to testFile\"\n   331→      function: \"sys.Stat(testFile)\"\n   332→    expected:\n   333→      postcondition: Nlink == 2\n   334→    traces:\n   335→      - prd002-sys R2.2\n   336→\n   337→  - name: sigpipe_handler_exit_zero\n   338→    description: InstallSIGPIPEHandler causes exit 0 on broken pipe.\n   339→    inputs:\n   340→      function: \"sys.InstallSIGPIPEHandler() then write to closed pipe\"\n   341→    expected:\n   342→      exit_code: 0\n   343→    traces:\n   344→      - prd002-sys R3.1\n   345→\n   346→  - name: on_terminal_resize_callback\n   347→    description: OnTerminalResize registers a callback invoked on SIGWINCH.\n   348→    inputs:\n   349→      function: \"sys.OnTerminalResize(callback) then send SIGWINCH\"\n   350→    expected:\n   351→      postcondition: callback was called with a positive width\n   352→    traces:\n   353→      - prd002-sys R4.1\n   354→      - prd002-sys R4.2\n   355→\n   356→  - name: cross_platform_compile\n   357→    description: All pkg/sys code compiles on darwin/arm64 and linux/amd64.\n   358→    inputs:\n   359→      command: \"GOOS=darwin GOARCH=arm64 go build ./pkg/sys/ && GOOS=linux GOARCH=amd64 go build ./pkg/sys/\"\n   360→    expected:\n   361→      exit_code: 0\n   362→    traces:\n   363→      - prd002-sys R1.2\n   364→\n   365→  # --- uc004-testutils: pkg/testutils differential testing harness ---\n   366→\n   367→  - name: difftest_zero_value\n   368→    description: DiffTest zero value is a valid test case that runs without error.\n   369→    inputs:\n   370→      function: \"testutils.RunDiffTests(t, echoBin, echoBin, []DiffTest{{Name: \\\"zero\\\"}})\"\n   371→    expected:\n   372→      postcondition: test passes with no output\n   373→    